    "en": "The exam was quite difficult."
   },
   {
    "t": "Il court vite.",
    "ko": "그는 빨리 달려요.",
    "en": "He runs fast."
   },
   {
    "t": "Conduisez prudemment.",
    "ko": "조심해서 운전하세요.",
